{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t05_01",
      "hash64": "BA36BFB0DDBC3C66",
      "text": "我和摩托蜥是穿过沙漠来的，\\n都累坏了～！\\c\\n人和宝可梦都要\\n好好休息一下才行啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t05_03",
      "hash64": "BA36BDB0DDBC3900",
      "text": "这里是渍沁镇。\\n知名的市场非常热闹！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t05_08",
      "hash64": "BA36C8B0DDBC4BB1",
      "text": "走过路过不要错过！\\n新鲜的好货应有尽有！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t05_10",
      "hash64": "BA33BAB0DDB9FE10",
      "text": "所谓渍沁，就是腌渍的意思。\\n是用柠檬汁或醋来腌肉或鱼的烹调法！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t05_11",
      "hash64": "BA33BBB0DDB9FFC3",
      "text": "在这个城镇，\\n吃的东西味道都～很好！\\c\\n素材又新鲜又有活力！\\n简直就像我一样～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t05_37",
      "hash64": "BA3A41B0DDBF4F23",
      "text": "市场里有对战场！\\c\\n这里是禁止争执的！\\n想决胜负就要通过宝可梦对战哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t05_38",
      "hash64": "BA3A4EB0DDBF653A",
      "text": "好像在我出生之前，\\n这个市场总是不断发生争执！\\c\\n现在不但观光客变多了，\\n小孩子也能放心到这里来了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t05_39",
      "hash64": "BA3A4FB0DDBF66ED",
      "text": "这位学生，\\n你也要参加拍卖吗？\\c\\n小心别把价格喊得太高，\\n最后变成穷光蛋啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t05_52",
      "hash64": "BA4154B0DDC58E1A",
      "text": "一到晚上，城镇的上空\\n就会出现幽灵宝可梦。\\r\\n……这是为什么呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t05_66",
      "hash64": "BA4B42B0DDCDC409",
      "text": "从海上吹来的海风\\n让人感觉好舒服～！\\c\\n但钢属性的宝可梦\\n可能不愿意被盐腌？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t05_73",
      "hash64": "BA47BDB0DDCAAC33",
      "text": "坐骑宝可梦很可靠！\\c\\n偶尔也换我来背它吧！\\n啊哈哈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t05_82",
      "hash64": "BA524EB0DDD3F71B",
      "text": "又是传单！\\c\\n把它团成球\\n来和宝可梦玩好了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t05_83",
      "hash64": "BA524DB0DDD3F568",
      "text": "这个方方的东西是集装箱哦。\\c\\n我们会把很多货物塞进去，\\n再运到大海的对面去。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t05_85",
      "hash64": "BA5253B0DDD3FF9A",
      "text": "去遥远的地方时，要坐船去！\\n因为靠坐骑宝可梦的话，会很累的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t05_86",
      "hash64": "BA5252B0DDD3FDE7",
      "text": "我游到对面的岩石地带时，\\n看到岩石地带上好像有什么东西……！\\c\\n不过爬不上悬崖的话，\\n恐怕是拿不到的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t05_87",
      "hash64": "BA5251B0DDD3FC34",
      "text": "哇～用脸部镂空拍照板\\n能拍出很有趣的照片哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t05_88",
      "hash64": "BA5248B0DDD3ECE9",
      "text": "哎，我知道这只是波普海豚，\\n但壮壮的那只是什么……？\\r\\n有那样的宝可梦……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t05_89",
      "hash64": "BA5247B0DDD3EB36",
      "text": "大电海燕在海面上飞翔的样子\\n真的很上相呢～\\c\\n那些孩子偶尔会在\\n城镇后面的海滩休息哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t05_95",
      "hash64": "BA4ECFB0DDD0E977",
      "text": "你去玻瓶市的海岱俱乐部\\n吃饭了吗？\\c\\n听说那里用的是\\n渍沁的新鲜食材！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t05_96",
      "hash64": "BA4ED0B0DDD0EB2A",
      "text": "玻瓶道馆的海岱\\n偶尔会来这个市场！\\c\\n他要是在拍卖中获胜，\\n就会高兴得手舞足蹈。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t05_97",
      "hash64": "BA4ED1B0DDD0ECDD",
      "text": "我年轻的时候\\n又是玩拍卖又是爱打架，\\r\\n各种不安分的事可是没少干。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "t05_121",
      "hash64": "1FEAE788C3102BA5",
      "text": "这么好的海滩却很少有人知道！\\n大家都沉迷于市场呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
